#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = rene kanter i spillets renderstørrelse. DLSS = det samme, og opskalerer, når spillets "
"Skalering er under 100 %. fra = spillets eget billede: til sammenligning. Gemmes med det samme."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Forudindstillinger til din GPU. høj = alt tændt (model 1). middel = model 2, halv gennemsigtig "
"dybde, flade spejle uden delbevægelse, lettere søgning. lav = også ingen spejl-DLAA, ingen "
"gennemsigtig dybde, VR-område 60 %. Ændrer aldrig noget, du selv har sat."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = mest detalje, skarpeste tekst, ca. 1,6x GPU af 2. 2 (E) = afbalanceret, mindst "
"spøgelsesbilleder bag trafik: start her. 3 (F) = roligst ved hegn og ledninger, kan smøre "
"bevægelige detaljer, samme pris som 2. 4 (M) = tungest (ca. 5x), kun til flade tests."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Billedkvalitet: skarphed, teksturskarphed, DLAA-området og gennemsigtig dybde. Højre åbner "
"gruppen, venstre lukker den; den er lukket hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Skærper billedet efter DLAA, 0 (fra) til 1,0. Hæv, hvis billedet er blødt; for højt giver lyse "
"kanter. Koster ca. 0,1 ms; 0 springer trinnet over."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Skærpningens rækkevidde, 1 til 4 px: lille = fine detaljer, stor = kraftigere kanter. Ret, hvis "
"den virker for fin eller grov; et billede større end skærmen (VR) kræver mere end 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Skarpere tekst i teksturer (skilte, instrumentbræt, GPS). 0 = fra; mere negativ = skarpere, men "
"mere flimmer på hegn; prøv -0,5 til -1 ved sløret tekst. Ingen GPU-tid, kun lidt "
"hukommelsesbåndbredde."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"Det samme for trådhegn, græs og bladudskæringer: hæv mod 0, hvis hegn flimrer, sænk, hvis græs er "
"blødt. samme = følger rækken ovenfor. Virker kun, når Teksturskarphed ikke er 0. Ingen GPU-tid, "
"lidt hukommelse."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: kun midten af hvert øje får DLAA (20 til 100 %); kanten beholder spillets billede. Sænk for "
"en tungere model eller flere fps; 40 % koster ca. 40 % af modellen. Gælder også "
"garage-/hovedmenu-lastbilen."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Kun flad: DLAA før spillets bloom/tonemap, så vejstriber, ledninger og skinner flimrer mindre. "
"Ret kun for at sammenligne. Ikke med DLSS-opskalering eller Windows-HDR. Samme pris; skift tager "
"~60 billeder."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Giver ledninger, hegn og glas deres egen afstand i stedet for det bagved, så de ikke smører ved "
"bevægelse. Slå fra, hvis intet smører: sparer 0,02 - 0,06 ms pr. øje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Forhindrer, at glød fra gadelamper og bilfyr efterlader spor ved bevægelse: DLSS tager hver glød "
"fra det aktuelle billede, ikke historikken. Trin på 25 %; sænk, hvis gløden flimrer, 0 = fra. "
"Koster ca. 0,05 - 0,2 ms pr. øje."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Hvordan DLAA håndterer bevægelige dele og lastbilspejle. Højre åbner gruppen, venstre lukker den; "
"den er lukket hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Giver hver bevægelig del (trafik, hjul, nummerplader) sin egen bevægelse til DLAA, så den "
"forbliver skarp uden spøgelser. Slå kun fra for at spare ca. 0,5 ms pr. øje eller teste: hver "
"pixel følger så kameraet, og trafik smører."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Giver lastbilspejle deres eget DLAA, så de ikke flimrer. 1 spejl = kun det største (hovedspejlet "
"ved siden af dig). alle = hvert spejl. kamera = billigst pr. spejl, trafik kan spøge i glasset; "
"ellers bevæger hver del sig præcist i glasset."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"til = hvert spejl får sit DLAA hvert 2. billede og viser det sidste rene billede imellem: ca. "
"halv spejlpris. Kanter forbliver rene; bevægelse i glasset opdateres med halv hastighed. fra = "
"hvert spejl hvert billede."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Tynde ledninger bevarer deres bevægelse under kørsel: DLAA spreder bevægelsesdata over tynde "
"linjer (DLSS motion dilation). til = standard. fra = kun til sammenligning; nære ledninger "
"flimrer mere. Billedet er kort blødt ved skift."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Tynde ledninger får dybde på hver pixel, de rører, ikke kun hvor de dækker et pixelcentrum. til = "
"standard. til (uden A2C) = også til gennemsigtige kanter. fra = kun til sammenligning; nære "
"ledninger flimrer mere."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentel: tegner fjerne ledninger tyndere end 1 pixel som en linje på 1 pixel, så de ikke "
"brydes i streger. Fra som standard: fjerne ledninger kan se mørkere ud eller flimre mere. Prøv og "
"sammenlign."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"DLSS-opskalering, DLAA-kontakten og info om OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Højre åbner gruppen, venstre "
"lukker den; den er lukket hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"DLSS tegner billedet tilbage i fuld størrelse, når spillets Skalering er under 100 %: skarpere "
"end spillets eget stræk, og færre pixels giver flere fps. Ingen ekstra pris; gør intet ved "
"Skalering 100 %."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Slår hele modden til eller fra og husker tilstanden; fra viser spillets eget billede til "
"sammenligning. Fra sparer prisen for alle dele samlet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR-framegenerering af djules75, en separat download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). fundet = laget er indlæst i spillet, og modden lader dets "
"arbejde passere. Start dets tray-app før spillet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = en OpenXR-udvidelsespakke af DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"dybde, framegenerering; fundet = laget er indlæst i spillet, og modden lader dets arbejde "
"passere. Brug kun én Turbo (dens eller modden)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"VR-speedups: Turbo, foveated rendering og masken for skjult område. Højre åbner gruppen, venstre "
"lukker den; den er lukket hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: ingen ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojektion. Kun VR. Til = spillet venter ikke på "
"headsettet hvert billede: kun flere fps, når CPU'en er grænsen (travle byer, trafik). Fra, hvis "
"billedet hakker. Fra OpenXR Toolkit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Skarpt centrum, mindre detalje i kanten (kun NVIDIA RTX). Sparer GPU-tid ved høj Skalering. Kun "
"VR. Den ydre ring skygges én gang pr. 2 x 2 pixels; hegn, græs og blade beholder fuld detalje. "
"Fra, hvis kanten ser blokket ud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Hvor stort det skarpe centrum i Foveated (VRS) er, 10 - 100 % i trin på 5 %: større = mere af "
"synet skarpt, mindre besparelse; mindre = mere besparelse, lavere detalje starter tættere på "
"midten. 80 % (balanceret) er standard; 90 = bred, 65 = smal."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Hvilke af spillets render-pass Foveated (VRS) virker på. scene = kun 3D-verdenen (standard). "
"scene + lys = også lyspasset, kun yderst: mere besparelse. Test det: se efter blokkede lys- eller "
"skyggekanter i siden af synet."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Hvor grov den ydre ring i Foveated (VRS) er. Normal = 1 farve pr. 2 x 2 pixels (standard). "
"Kraftig = pr. 4 x 2, Maks = pr. 4 x 4: mere GPU-besparelse, mere blokkede kanter. Bedst med "
"eyetracking, hvor du aldrig ser på den ydre ring."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Eksperimentel. Det skarpe centrum i Foveated (VRS) følger dine øjne på et headset med eyetracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, fx Varjo); uden bliver det i linsemidten. Foveated (VRS) skal være til ved "
"spilstart, ellers genstart. Næsten ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR. Spillet springer linsehjørnerne over, du aldrig ser (headsettet melder dem), og tegner "
"færre pixels: mere GPU-luft, billedet du ser er det samme. Første aktivering kræver genstart af "
"spillet. Fra, hvis synsfeltets kant ser forkert ud."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Billedhastighedsgrænser og CPU: NVIDIA Reflex og en fps-grænse til flad, en VR-fps-grænse, "
"CPU-tuning. Højre åbner gruppen, venstre lukker den; den er lukket hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Kun flad, kun NVIDIA. Til = spillets billeder venter mindre i GPU-køen: mindre input-lag, når "
"GPU'en er grænsen. Boost holder også GPU-urene oppe. Samme fps; lille pris. Ikke i VR."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Kun flad. Holder spillet på højst denne billedhastighed: jævn frametid, mindre varme og strøm. "
"Sæt den lidt under, hvad din pc holder i en travl by. Med Reflex til begrænser NVIDIA-driveren. "
"fra = ingen grænse."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR. halv = spillet tegner hvert 2. headsetbillede (72 Hz -> 36 fps), tredjedel = hvert 3.; "
"headsettets reprojektion (ASW / Motion Smoothing) udfylder resten i jævn rytme. Brug det, når fps "
"svinger. Slår Turbo fra, mens det er til."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tre CPU-kontakter samlet: hoved- og rendertråden foretrækker P-cores (kun Intel-hybrid-CPU'er), "
"spillet kører med prioritet Over normal, og Windows må ikke drosle det (EcoQoS) eller ignorere "
"dets timeranmodninger. Hjælper, når CPU'en er grænsen; ingen omkostning. Enkeltvis i dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Panelets placering, størrelse, dybde og retning samt menutasterne. Højre åbner gruppen, venstre "
"lukker den; den er lukket hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR. Følg hoved = panelet følger headsettet. Fast i førerhus = det bliver på ét sted foran dit "
"sæde, roligt når du ser dig om; X / Y / dybde styrer så stedet (grader, meter). Kræver VR-laget "
"(standard). Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flytter panelet sidelæns, i % af skærmen (VR fast i førerhus: grader omkring dit sæde). Flad og "
"VR har hver deres placering. Brug det, hvis panelet dækker noget, du skal bruge. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flytter panelet op / ned, i % af skærmen (VR fast i førerhus: grader, plus = ned). Flad og VR har "
"hver deres placering. Brug det, hvis panelet dækker noget, du skal bruge. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Gør panelet større eller mindre. Hæv, hvis du ikke kan læse det, sænk, hvis det dækker for meget. "
"Flad og VR har hver deres størrelse. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Hvor langt væk panelet svæver: i meter (0,30 - 3,00) som VR-lag, "
"standard; i px indadgående forskydning pr. øje med menu_vr_layer = 0. Samme størrelse ved enhver "
"dybde. Ret, hvis panelet er trættende at se på. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Til = panelet drejer mod dig, når du flytter det til siden, samme "
"størrelse fra alle vinkler (som VR-lag, standard, også den hovedfølgende fps-tæller); fra = et "
"fladt billede. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"En lille live-boks med fps og frametid, også når menuen er lukket (flad og VR). Brug den til at "
"se, hvad en indstilling giver. GPU-prisen er målt: pr. billede, hvert billede den tegnes i; ingen "
"når fra. Gem beholder den til næste start."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Fps-tællerens lås, placering, størrelse, farve, VR-afstand og drejning. Højre åbner gruppen, "
"venstre lukker den; den er lukket hver gang menuen åbnes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR. Følg hoved = følger headsettet. Fast i spilleområdet = ét sted omkring dit sæde, "
"ignorerer førerhusets vuggen. Fast på køretøj = sidder på førerhuset, vugger med (kræver DLAA + "
"bevægelsesvektorer pr. del). Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, kun Fast på køretøj. Til = hver lastbil / bil beholder sin egen placering, drejning, "
"størrelse, farve, lysstyrke og tekst for fps-tælleren i førerhuset (gemmes i dlaa.ini, når menuen "
"lukkes). Fra = ét fælles sæt til alle køretøjer. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, kun Fast på køretøj. Højre = mål førerhuset igen nu (sid stille, parkeret), hvis boksen "
"sidder forkert. Venstre = dette køretøjs boks tilbage til standard (sted, drejning, størrelse, "
"farve, tekst); andre køretøjer beholder deres. Boksen står vinkelret på førerhuset."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flytter fps-tælleren sidelæns, i % af skærmen (VR fast / fastgjort: grader omkring dig). Flad og "
"VR har hver deres placering. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Flytter fps-tælleren op / ned, i % af skærmen (VR fast / fastgjort: grader, minus = op). Flad og "
"VR har hver deres placering. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Drejer fps-tælleren til venstre / højre om sig selv, i grader (+ = "
"forsiden drejer mod højre). Brug det til at vinkle den, når den sidder i siden. 0 = den vender "
"mod dig. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Vipper fps-tælleren, i grader (+ = toppen læner væk fra dig, som lå "
"den på instrumentbrættet). 0 = den vender mod dig. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Roterer fps-tælleren i sit eget plan, i grader (+ = med uret). 0 = "
"oprejst. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Gør fps-tælleren større eller mindre (0,2 .. 3,0). Hæv, hvis du ikke kan læse den i headsettet "
"eller på en stor skærm. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Farven på fps-tællerens tekst: 20 farver, hver med omrids, så den kan læses på ethvert billede "
"(sort på hvid = mørk tekst, hvid kontur). Flad og VR. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Hvor lys fps-tælleren er, 10 - 100 %: 100 = farven som den er, lavere dæmper teksten (omridset "
"bliver) mod sort. Brug det til at dæmpe tælleren om natten eller i headsettet. Flad og VR. Ingen "
"omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Hvor gennemsigtig hele fps-tælleren er, 10 - 100 %: 100 = massiv, lavere toner teksten OG det "
"sorte omrids ud sammen, så en dæmpet tæller ikke bliver en sort klat. Flad og VR. Ingen "
"omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Kun VR, derfor gråt i flad. Hvor langt væk fps-tælleren svæver, 0,30 - 3,00 m. Den har samme "
"størrelse i dit syn på alle afstande; kun dybden ændres. Sæt den nær den dybde, du ser på, så du "
"kan læse den uden at fokusere om. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"Hvad der skrives i dlaa_inject.log: fra = intet; fejl = kun fejl (standard); advarsler = + "
"omgåede problemer; info = + opstart og ændringer; fejlsøgning = + statistik, og fejlsøgning kører "
"også GPU-timerne og CPU-profileren."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Dette menus sprog. auto = spillets sprog (standard); venstre / højre vælger et andet. Linux / "
"Proton: kinesisk, japansk og koreansk kræver deres skrifttyper, se README. En lang\\<code>.po ved "
"siden af DLL'en vinder, til egne rettelser. Gem beholder den. Ingen omkostning."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Hver genvej i dette menu, én linje pr. handling, med tastaturtast og controllerknap. Højre åbner "
"listen; vælg en handling med højre, og tryk derefter den nye tast eller rat-knap. Gemmes straks i "
"dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Skriver alt, der vises her, til dlaa.ini (indstillinger og panelets / fps-tællerens placering, "
"når du har flyttet dem), alle andre linjer bevares. Gør det, når du er tilfreds, ellers er "
"ændringerne væk ved næste start. Tilstanden gemmer sig selv."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Sætter hver indstilling i dette menu tilbage til, som modden leveres (model, skarphed, "
"teksturskarphed, DLAA-område, bevægelse, spejle, profil, panel, fps-tæller, turbo, foveated, "
"billedhastighed, logning), live og i dlaa.ini; dine genveje og alle andre linjer bevares."

